  "title": "AI Is Disrupting the Entire Economy, Not Just the Tech Stack – Brett Rochkind, SoftBank Investment Advisers",
  "summary": "Artificial intelligence has been a theme at technology conferences for years. At the Jefferies Private Growth Conference in Santa Monica this April however, it was the reality shaping nearly every conversation. Few are better positioned to assess that shift than Brett Rochkind, Managing Partner at SoftBank Investment Advisers, whose firm has placed one of the largest single bets in venture history on the AI era.",
